  "system": {
    "identifier": "hyuga-lion-palm",
    "description": "<p>The ultimate main branches jutsu. You release Chakra from your hands molding it into two guardian lions with a visible and intimidating presence.</p>\n<p>For the Duration of this jutsu, you do not spend Chakra to maintain this jutsu.</p>\n<p>As part of the requirements of this jutsu you must have Byakugan active and be benefitting from the Gentle Fist Stance.</p>\n<p>Unarmed attacks using the Gentle Fist Stance and Hyūga Clan Hijutsu that make Melee Taijutsu attacks use a D10 for Chakra damage, in place of any listed damage die for chakra damage.</p>\n<p>Additionally, in place of any attack you make as part of the attack action or a Hyuga Hijutsu you cast, you can make a ranged Taijutsu attack on a creature you can see up to 30 feet away, firing off one of the Lions like a missile, dealing 3d10 + your highest ability modifier Force damage.</p>",
